react-bitcoin-qr
========

React.js Bitcoin QR code component.


Installation
------------

    npm i --save react-bitcoin-qr


Usage
-----

```js
var QRCode = require('react-bitcoin-qr')

var component = React.createClass({
  render () {
    <BitcoinQRCode address='1PEoUKNxTZsc5rFSQvQjeTVwDE9vEDCRWm' amount='10000' message='Ten thousand satoshi donation to BitGive' />
  }
})
```

